    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Operation Zero</strong> is top-down run-n-gun arcade shooter with a sci-fi comedy edge.\u00a0A mysterious and threatening artificial intelligence is spreading across New America, and only one hero has the brawn, firepower and ignorance to stop it: TASKILLER, the ultimate bio-engineered super-soldier!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412540/extras/b78840a1d29eb8dc63bf28531137cc44.poster.avif?t=1751509856\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412540/extras/b78840a1d29eb8dc63bf28531137cc44.webm?t=1751509856\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412540/extras/b78840a1d29eb8dc63bf28531137cc44.mp4?t=1751509856\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll need the help of the GENERAL and some state-of-the-art firepower to blast your way through hordes of AI-deranged droids and drones to reach the nerve center of 8  secret bases, each more dangerous than the last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Top-down run-n-gun action... fans of  the late 80's and 90's arcade classics will feel right at home</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Twin-Stick controls by default, but configurable  to suit other styles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 missions to take on,  containing 5-7 levels each, spanning forests, secret bases and underground AI nerve centers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arena Mode: a non-narrative &quot;infinite&quot; way to play - see how long you can survive against a never ending barrage of enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomly generated levels for extra replayability</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plentiful and stackable weapon powerups to form interesting and deadly combinations. Including but not limited to rapid, bounce, spread, split, explosive...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Personal drone powerups to augment your firepower</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Narrative moments peppered into each level to propel Taskiller's story forward. \u00a0All is not as it seems in New America....</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Operation Zero</strong> is top-down run-n-gun arcade shooter with a sci-fi comedy edge.\u00a0A mysterious and threatening artificial intelligence is spreading across New America, and only one hero has the brawn, firepower and ignorance to stop it: TASKILLER, the ultimate bio-engineered super-soldier!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412540/extras/b78840a1d29eb8dc63bf28531137cc44.poster.avif?t=1751509856\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412540/extras/b78840a1d29eb8dc63bf28531137cc44.webm?t=1751509856\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412540/extras/b78840a1d29eb8dc63bf28531137cc44.mp4?t=1751509856\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll need the help of the GENERAL and some state-of-the-art firepower to blast your way through hordes of AI-deranged droids and drones to reach the nerve center of 8  secret bases, each more dangerous than the last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Top-down run-n-gun action... fans of  the late 80's and 90's arcade classics will feel right at home</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Twin-Stick controls by default, but configurable  to suit other styles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 missions to take on,  containing 5-7 levels each, spanning forests, secret bases and underground AI nerve centers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arena Mode: a non-narrative &quot;infinite&quot; way to play - see how long you can survive against a never ending barrage of enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomly generated levels for extra replayability</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plentiful and stackable weapon powerups to form interesting and deadly combinations. Including but not limited to rapid, bounce, spread, split, explosive...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Personal drone powerups to augment your firepower</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Narrative moments peppered into each level to propel Taskiller's story forward. \u00a0All is not as it seems in New America....</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p>",
